{"uid":"bd3f5386ae029712","name":"test_an_idle_finished_run_with_a_live_container_is_still_deletable","fullName":"tests.test_hub_delete#test_an_idle_finished_run_with_a_live_container_is_still_deletable","historyId":"d25c6aeeeb9a4f8dd294a484708f2f4a","time":{"start":1791925494981,"stop":1791925497164,"duration":2183},"description":"Fact 3 (PRD): `on_complete: idle` keeps a finished run's container up\n    ON PURPOSE. The gate must key on the recorded STATE (the engine no\n    longer has work to do), never on whether the container happens to still\n    be running -- otherwise every `on_complete: idle` run becomes\n    permanently undeletable the moment requirement A's `finishing` state\n    lands. This is the regression the obvious \"refuse while a container is\n    up\" fix would introduce.","descriptionHtml":"<p>Fact 3 (PRD): <code>on_complete: idle</code> keeps a finished run's container up<br />\nON PURPOSE. The gate must key on the recorded STATE (the engine no<br />\nlonger has work to do), never on whether the container happens to still<br />\nbe running -- otherwise every <code>on_complete: idle</code> run becomes<br />\npermanently undeletable the moment requirement A's <code>finishing</code> state<br />\nlands. This is the regression the obvious &quot;refuse while a container is<br />\nup&quot; fix would introduce.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791925216356,"stop":1791925216356,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791925216356,"stop":1791925216357,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false